Usage: ms dev doc

Tools for working on Manuscript itself. They are not part of writing programs and may change without notice.

  doc  Print the documentation of the bundled standard library as versioned JSON: every importable module
       (prelude first, then by path) with its declarations, their source excerpts, descriptions, declared effects and
       documented members. tools/docgen.ms builds the API reference, the downloads and the description coverage from it.

Options:
  -h, --help  Show this help

Examples:
  ms dev doc > stdlib.json
